[{"title":"鸡鸣台","author":"范镇","text":"古人惟恃众心城，何事秦皇苦好兵。\n本设函关禁奸诈，不知半夜有鸡鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38071,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上岩","author":"范镇","text":"岩雨晴犹滴，溪泉直复迂。\n倾崖目眩转，乱石步崎岖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38072,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成都观牡丹","author":"范镇","text":"自古成都胜，开花不似今。\n径围三尺大，颜色几重深。\n未放香喷雪，仍藏蕊散金。\n要知空色论，聊见主人心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38073,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题静照堂","author":"范镇","text":"堂构虚閒处，师心静照中。\n当门自流水，满院占清风。\n趺坐通禅观，高谈说性空。\n那知人世上，日月有樊笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38074,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次张寺丞园","author":"范镇","text":"园林再到身犹健，官职全抛梦乍醒。\n惟有南山与君眼，相逢不改旧时青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38075,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冯允南远贶佳作有舜律远相通之句因次韵寄之","author":"范镇","text":"盛旦真明圣，平生伏至公。\n遭逢不世出，覆露与天同。\n谅直诚多勉，谋猷愧罔功。\n后王明若日，夷夏庆同风。\n喜气中兼外，欢谣北至东。\n敢图严密禁，擢处太清宫。\n峻拔山形大，高明地望雄。\n起居无忘古，坐卧只思忠。\n论乐嗟沦废，求音扣寂空。\n大和非隐伏，至理自穹崇。\n暧昧幽还显，尊卑降复隆。\n使人思舞凤，如弋慕飞鸿。\n世事安清谧，人心处正中。\n至醇当直诣，精义故旁通。\n本自关瑶律，还须抚素桐。\n天材由圣作，物理要人穷。\n往古为经始，来今是考终。\n云为极微妙，襟抱贮冲融。\n敛聚阴阳气，窥观造化工。\n因君说乐事，诗咏照光虹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38076,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和冯允南二首 其一","author":"范镇","text":"小马轻舆蜀道难，身披裘褐顶峨冠。\n已从林下幽人往，犹作朝中旧德看。\n渔钓喜欢新得侣，道途瞻顾尚呼官。\n多惭乡友贻清唱，天外鸾音与凤翰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38077,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和冯允南二首 其二","author":"范镇","text":"常望乡山忆翠微，此来时节更春晖。\n林间怨鹤久招隐，花外啼鹃仍劝归。\n云似随人飞缥缥，雨如先道洒霏霏。\n回思仕宦平生事，六十三年始悟非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38078,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送祖龙学择之赴陜府酌饮赠别次欧阳永叔韵","author":"范镇","text":"史君分陜惜别难，缓听长吟速行酒。\n荆山北面黄河南，千里封疆为己有。\n往来无穷西复东，衮衮轮蹄利名走。\n甘棠虽云勿剪伐，未必从前不伤手。\n当时遗爱安在哉，赖有声诗传不朽。\n择之寸刃如新硎，历年何啻十有九。\n胸中蕴蓄富术业，此行直欲古人偶。\n近世只知厨传为，不顾虚名似箕斗。\n寄言道路如采诗，但问樵夫与田叟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38079,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李才元寄示蜀中花图","author":"范镇","text":"牡丹名品众，特地盛于今。\n西子含羞甚，东君著意深。\n障行施烂锦，屋贮用黄金。\n妾婢群花卉，那能不妒心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38080,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望湖台","author":"范镇","text":"台上望城下，迢遥知几寻。\n湖光隐隐见，多碍柳烟深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38081,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万艘潭","author":"范镇","text":"私船官运斗纵横，殖货交通绕近城。\n灯火夜凉人未散，古潭宜复万艘名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38082,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金莲泉","author":"范镇","text":"道侣殷勤凿石渠，金莲泉脉入灵都。\n暗穿竹径仍清冷，为我烹茶敌酪奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38083,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和君实早朝书事","author":"范镇","text":"日气晓先赤，天形秋转高。\n风轻金辔勒，霜重毳衣袍。\n匹马精神倦，前驺意思豪。\n近来君在告，连直几番鳌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38084,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻蝉","author":"范镇","text":"山中气候别，二月已闻蝉。\n乍到清凉景，翻疑暑伏天。\n此身多暇日，何事更惊年。\n杂溜淙淙响，相和胜管弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38085,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿憩鹤寺","author":"范镇","text":"憩鹤山间憩竹舆，宛然身世住空虚。\n地仙纵与天仙别，明月清风也不疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38086,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和司马君实游喷玉潭","author":"范镇","text":"畏风垂首立，临水侧身行。\n更拂悬崖壁，援毫写姓名。\n一道来何处，千寻正面前。\n时时玉麈下，纷泊鬓毛间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38087,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游喷玉潭","author":"范镇","text":"大风吹沙高翳天，万木簸荡鸣空山。\n夜来奥热今斗寒，下舆乱石崎岖间。\n急著冒絮衣纯棉，两边荆棘难跻攀。\n行到君实所诧处，却坐拂拭尘土颜。\n千尺瀑布才涓涓，深潭寂寞神龙跧。\n此来好事慎勿传，乞得性命成生还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38088,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿安","author":"范镇","text":"锦屏山下锦江人，西去东来自在身。\n正是春天好时节，枉遭风起作埃尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38089,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实喷玉潭","author":"范镇","text":"夜月光华照洁清，春云容与覆峥嵘。\n都城咫尺无人到，却使庐山浪得名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38090,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实叠石溪","author":"范镇","text":"到处窥泉窦，逢人问草名。\n簪裳已无累，猜鸟不须惊。\n对景有诗癖，酌泉无酒狂。\n山间少尘土，云际足春阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38091,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叠石溪","author":"范镇","text":"昨旦愁风色，今朝喜日华。\n从容下官道，迤逦见人家。\n盛服缘崖看，焚香满路遮。\n樵柯成市井，陶穴乃生涯。\n春石声相应，沉泥处或洼。\n累墙瓷隐辚，开径石槎牙。\n柴积高于阜，钓槃疾甚车。\n自非秦世避，谁道舜风遐。\n拄杖逢山斗，回舆值水斜。\n远林行翠凤，幽隧转青蛇。\n泉眼思搴藻，云头望采花。\n仰身书叠壁，平坐挹飞霞。\n有景殊难纪，兹游信可誇。\n君如别业就，后会固无差。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38092,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"镇卜居许下虽未有涯先作五十六言奉寄子华相公持国端明玉汝待制","author":"范镇","text":"四十年来作往还，如今那怪鬓毛斑。\n凫居雁户得安处，鹤怨猿惊羞故山。\n静乐顾子难独享，公忙何日见君闲。\n相将嵩少深深处，更共眠云紫翠间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38093,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实喜雨三首 其一","author":"范镇","text":"夜中间点滴，晓后见沉阴。\n正惧一时旱，何妨三日霖。\n著花开稍晚，入麦润还深。\n想象离栏处，高张烂锦衾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38094,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实喜雨三首 其二","author":"范镇","text":"图馆春无赖，田家岁有收。\n那能垤鹳咏，还似土龙求。\n木荫疏成密，云容去复留。\n已然为恶客，泥泞亦须游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38095,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实喜雨三首 其三","author":"范镇","text":"一春忧旱熯，田里欲蹉跎。\n正合为霖望，翻成击壤歌。\n风缘帘隙至，云压舍檐过。\n大尹今朝喜，应同野老多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38096,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖泛舟辄用前韵寄呈君实","author":"范镇","text":"画船容与到桥还，举袂依然洛酒斑。\n湖上晓光涵潩水，坐中晴色见嵩山。\n心缘念别如多事，身为移居似不闲。\n叠石石淙虽两处，福昌阳翟正中间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38097,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实新买叠石溪庄","author":"范镇","text":"画处始知蛇足剩，管中那识豹文斑。\n从来有道须康世，未省升平却住山。\n学富名高难自晦，眼昏心悸始能闲。\n计君叠山溪边景，不得从容岁月閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38098,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠僧中海渊还阆","author":"范镇","text":"旧乡山水绕禅扃，日日山光与水声。\n归去定贪山水乐，不教魂梦到神京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38099,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张职方守筠州","author":"范镇","text":"南国一麾守，知公安此行。\n家山虽万里，子舍只邻城。\n驿问中宵至，风谣接畛声。\n定应持课最，同命到天京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38100,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吏隐堂","author":"范镇","text":"花阴柳榻常攲枕，月色侵门不下关。\n因讽君诗想佳景，夜凉依约梦魂间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38101,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"范镇","text":"翠幕瑶梯百尺楼，楼前星斗自悠悠。\n天家仙会能多少，未到平明已别愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38102,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至史局","author":"范镇","text":"史局逾年别，重来已涕零。\n朱书未绝笔，又欲汗新青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38103,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送司封刘孝祥知资州","author":"范镇","text":"醮坛山下路，消息拟春风。\n遥知底处人，欢喜得西公。\n绣衣还西州，锦账空南宫。\n使君五马行，岂减御史骢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38104,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剑门关","author":"范镇","text":"云间双剑峰，壁立望西东。\n天地本无外，江山还自通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38105,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其一","author":"范镇","text":"可怜风信重秋期，红锦花香极所思。\n乞巧楼中成底事，平明祗得玩蛛丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38106,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其二","author":"范镇","text":"少年从此夕，渐老何所为。\n与子思故乡，置酒同赋诗。\n坐来霜露淡，夜久星斗稀。\n王宫直北里，天外横歌期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38107,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄绵竹致政杨郎中","author":"范镇","text":"竹里幽泉荷盖池，主人投绂自相宜。\n水风吹面难成醉，山月当头易得诗。\n漠漠稻畦翻虎掌，深深花坞结蜂脾。\n年来想像清高处，羞愧浮云满鬓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38108,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过友人墅居","author":"范镇","text":"翠树重重碧草齐，一丘真趣此衡栖。\n地盘山影春难老，门掩江声梦自迷。\n闲结柳条思远道，静书花叶寄春题。\n人间乐事无时足，便倚兰干到日西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38109,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送文与可通判邛州","author":"范镇","text":"半刺为官美，临邛自古名。\n何言缇轼宠，要侍版舆行。\n仙籍新年贵，宾僚旧日荣。\n壶桨故父老，应在半途迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38110,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和王都尉","author":"范镇","text":"惯乘霄汉鹤，翻说淤泥莲。\n可惜玉台处，等闲闲几年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38111,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗四首 其一","author":"范镇","text":"风定雪新晴，尘埃眼豁明。\n青山似相识，终日伴人行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38112,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗四首 其二","author":"范镇","text":"南来十日尽山行，北去前驱野稍平。\n边日照人如月色，野风吹草似泉声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38113,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗四首 其三","author":"范镇","text":"鸣笳悲咽愁须绝，猎骑盘旋画不成。\n待与故人閒说此，几时归得到天京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38114,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗四首 其四","author":"范镇","text":"马足知人意，骎骎不少留。\n路回山斗转，沙漫水平流。\n雪底青春动，林梢赤气浮。\n故园花发早，待得到家否。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38115,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"范镇","text":"倏忽平为险，分明假夺真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38116,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"范镇","text":"洞壑独嵌空，壁溜珠玉溅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38117,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"范镇","text":"半天开佛阁，平地见人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38118,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"范镇","text":"想像通恍惚，大木涵天风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38119,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"范镇","text":"云霞揖神仙，烟火认城郭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38120,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"范镇","text":"先生已何处，依旧白云飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38121,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"范镇","text":"西山瞰大江，迤逦龙鳞湿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38122,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"范镇","text":"回头恋翠峰，云与烟相袭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38123,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"范镇","text":"众山四面合，二水南北流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38124,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"范镇","text":"移家尚恐青山浅，隐几惟知白日长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38125,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"范镇","text":"不学乡人誇驷马，未饶吾祖泛扁舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38126,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"范镇","text":"生平欲报国，所得是知人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38127,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"范镇","text":"案前曾立二贤良。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38128,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十四","author":"范镇","text":"淡墨题名第一人，孤生何幸继前尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38129,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"胡恢","text":"建业关山千里远，长安风雪一家寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38130,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"胡恢","text":"怪鸟啼春不避人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38131,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"韩琦友","text":"是非莫问门前客，得失须凭塞上翁。\n引取碧油红旆去，邺王台畔醉春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38132,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耆英会诗","author":"赵丙","text":"新春鼎洛燕英髦，主礼雍容下庶僚。\n二相比肩官一品，十人华发事三朝。\n星阶并列瞻台曜，尊酒时行挹斗杓。\n东颍庸夫最无状，也将颜面趁嘉招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38133,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东池","author":"赵丙","text":"东池风物往来亲，兴在那能计酒巡。\n尘外留心曾待月，壶中满眼只知春。\n小诗前后题青竹，幽梦寻常访白蘋。\n鸥鸟亦知今日恨，主人别得两朱轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38134,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"药铛偈","author":"周贯","text":"顽钝天教合作铛，纵生三脚岂能行。\n虽然有耳不听法，只爱人间恋火坑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38135,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答人","author":"周贯","text":"八十西山作酒仙，麻鞋轧断布衣穿。\n相逢甲子君休问，太极光阴不计年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38136,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋谒李生","author":"周贯","text":"今年中秋夕，来赴去年约。\n不见破铁铛，弹指空剥剥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38137,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题虚白观","author":"周贯","text":"山郭十馀里，篮舆试初程。\n山高云气重，野旷烟光轻。\n断石络树根，敧崖溜泉声。\n行行款道宇，一径掌样平。\n仙隐记甘罗，观名取庄生。\n宝藏绚金碧，仙佩飞瑶琼。\n檐铎自相语，龛灯弄微明。\n出门境界宽，一笑大江横。\n蹁跹白羽衣，孤鹤松梢鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38138,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"周贯","text":"弹琴伤指甲，盖席损髭须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38139,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"季冬立春后有雪呈诸公","author":"白子仪","text":"南亩先曾集素霙，缤纷又拂岁峥嵘。\n得无留滞青春色，况复蔽亏红日明。\n司历不能分昼刻，勾芒何处待时行。\n岂如直近农耕候，万耳听来甘雨声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38140,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和抑之寒食 其一","author":"白子仪","text":"良辰今日正寒食，收拾宾槃宜再三。\n落笔唱酬宜不倦，把花醒醉亦何惭。\n客来常满眼无白，人道半痴心所甘。\n幸是禁烟芳节在，接䍦倒载定能堪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38141,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和抑之寒食 其二","author":"白子仪","text":"馀花茂草引醺酣，礼节休言爵止三。\n芳岁现逢虽强笑，少年相对但多惭。\n尚驱俗驾终何适，不辟愁门却未甘。\n难把长绳系春日，若非觞斝更谁堪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38142,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立夏后大热偶书","author":"白子仪","text":"朱辂初闻建赤旗，绿杨犹啭旧黄鹂。\n和风骀荡无三月，炎气凭陵又一时。\n飘去馀香花衬屐，覆来浓荫叶成帷。\n秋光只在前山里，不日凉襟却共披。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38143,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]